---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import ClosingCta from '../components/ClosingCta.astro';
import NameReveal from '../components/NameReveal.astro';
import Globe from '../components/Globe.astro';
import { site } from '../data/index.js';
---

<Base
  title="Our Story"
  description="ANCHATRA FARMS takes its name from Oddanchatram, the Tamil Nadu market town we call home. Read how local market relationships shaped an agricultural export business."
  image="market-stall.jpg"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1>We carry our hometown <em>in our name.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        ANCHATRA FARMS begins with a connection to place. Our name is drawn from Oddanchatram, the Tamil Nadu market town
        we call home.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The name, played out on the scroll -->
  <NameReveal />

  <!-- Founder + market relationships -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="roots-heading">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="split__media story-photo" data-reveal="wipe" data-parallax>
        <Photo file={site.locationImage.file} alt={site.locationImage.alt} ratio="4 / 5" />
        {site.locationImage.caption && <p class="photo-caption">{site.locationImage.caption}</p>}
      </div>
      <div class="split__body" data-reveal="right">
        <p class="eyebrow">Local roots</p>
        <h2 id="roots-heading">It started with people we know.</h2>
        <div class="prose" style="margin-top:1.75rem">
          <p>
            Oddanchatram is an agricultural market hub in Tamil Nadu. Its vegetable market is part of daily life in the
            town — a place where produce changes hands and where traders and shop owners know one another by name.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our founder is from Oddanchatram and has personal relationships with shop owners in that market. Through
            those relationships, our founder saw an opportunity to build a business connecting agricultural products with
            buyers beyond our region.
          </p>
          <p>
            That is the foundation of ANCHATRA FARMS: a sourcing business built on familiarity and trust at home, with
            the aim of earning the same from buyers abroad.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we offer -->
  <section class="section section--deep" aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What we offer</p>
          <h2 id="offer-heading">Fresh produce and processed products, side by side.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">
          Our focus brings together processed agricultural products such as black garlic and moringa powder with whole
          spices — green cardamom and black pepper — and fresh produce, including onions and tomatoes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="offer">
        <a class="offer__item" data-reveal="zoom" href="/products/black-garlic/">
          <Photo file="black-garlic-cloves.jpg" alt="Black garlic bulbs and peeled black cloves" cutout ratio="1" sizes="(min-width: 54rem) 25vw, 50vw" />
          <span>Black Garlic <Arrow /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer__item" data-reveal="zoom" href="/products/moringa-powder/">
          <Photo file="moringa-powder-tray.jpg" alt="Green moringa powder in a wooden tray" ratio="1" sizes="(min-width: 54rem) 25vw, 50vw" />
          <span>Moringa Powder <Arrow /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer__item" data-reveal="zoom" href="/products/onions/">
          <Photo file="onions-market.jpg" alt="Onions in a basket at a market stall" ratio="1" sizes="(min-width: 54rem) 25vw, 50vw" />
          <span>Onions <Arrow /></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer__item" data-reveal="zoom" href="/products/tomatoes/">
          <Photo file="tomatoes-basket.jpg" alt="A basket of freshly picked tomatoes" ratio="1" sizes="(min-width: 54rem) 25vw, 50vw" />
          <span>Tomatoes <Arrow /></span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="origin-note" data-reveal>
        A note on origin: Oddanchatram is where our business is rooted, not a claim about where every product is grown.
        We confirm the origin of each product with the buyer as part of the enquiry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How we want to work -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
    <div class="container work" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How we want to work</p>
        <h2 id="work-heading">An emerging business, straightforward about where it stands.</h2>
        <Globe />
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We are at the beginning of our export journey, and we would rather say so plainly. What we can promise today is
          how we will treat an enquiry: we will listen to what your market needs, tell you clearly what we can and cannot
          offer, and follow through on what we agree.
        </p>
        <p>
          As we develop our range, our ambition is to build lasting buyer relationships through clear communication and
          attention to each enquiry.
        </p>
        <p class="closing-line">
          We carry our hometown in our name—and an international outlook in our ambition.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/sourcing-quality/">How we approach sourcing &amp; quality <Arrow /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ClosingCta />
</Base>

<style>
  .work {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 54rem) {
    .work {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
    .work {
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  .offer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 54rem) {
    .offer {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  .offer__item {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.6rem 0;
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .offer__item:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .offer__item :global(.photo) {
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius-lg) - 0.6rem);
  }
  .story-photo :global(.photo) {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .offer__item :global(.photo--cutout) {
    background: var(--ivory);
  }
  .offer__item span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
  }
  .offer__item:hover span {
    color: var(--terracotta-deep);
  }
  .origin-note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--terracotta);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    max-width: 48em;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .closing-line {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--green) !important;
  }
</style>
